entries[439727] = { ["name"] = "Webbed Bismuth", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nA very common metal found across Khaz Algar. Despite being mundane, it is often desired in high quantities by skilled craftsman due to its versatile properties.\n\nWhile plantlife might make for a good nest for spiders, sometimes a web needs a solid foundation to support extra weight. The Spindlespiders of Khaz Algar often build up intricate webs on rocky outcrops, much to the dismay of arachnophobic miners.\n\nAt least they offer an extra source of cloth!" }
