entries[439729] = { ["name"] = "Webbed Ironclaw", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nA rare metal found throughout Khaz Algar, predominantly near or on the surface. As it is known for being extremely durable, blacksmiths often take a keen interest in acquiring large quantities of it.\n\nWhile plantlife might make for a good nest for spiders, sometimes a web needs a solid foundation to support extra weight. The Spindlespiders of Khaz Algar often build up intricate webs on rocky outcrops, much to the dismay of arachnophobic miners.\n\nAt least they offer an extra source of cloth!" }
entries[439730] = { ["name"] = "Void Missiles" }
entries[439732] = { ["name"] = "Streamlined Relic", ["text"] = "Instant\nWhile out of combat, the party's movement speed is increased by 10%. Upon entering combat, the party's haste is increased by 5% for 8 sec." }
entries[439735] = { ["name"] = "Rich Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSometimes abnormally large deposits emerge from beneath the surface, much to the delight of miners seeking the day's bread." }
entries[439736] = { ["name"] = "Seam Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nEven beneath the surface, seams rich in usable metal are a rare and exciting sight. They can typically be found on walls or ceilings in especially narrow spaces." }
entries[439737] = { ["name"] = "Crystallized Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nDue to their proximity to the Coreway, some deposits have a direct connection with the World Soul. Miners who gather from them will receive a small blessing in addition to some Crystalline Powder; a useful reagent in many crafts." }
entries[439738] = { ["name"] = "Weeping Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nThe Black Blood of the Old Gods has begun to pool beneath Khaz Algar, and its festering presence has even had an effect on the precious metals it touches. Miners who brave the darkest depths to gather from these deposits will experience agony the likes of which mortals were not meant to endure. Fortunately, survivors will recover some Writhing Samples for their efforts." }
entries[439739] = { ["name"] = "EZ-Mine Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nNature works in mysterious ways, but there is nothing natural about rocks covered in dynamite! Abnormally rich metal deposits spotted by \"helpful\" Engineers are sometimes rigged up for detonation for an easy yield, but they are often abandoned when the demolitionist come to their senses.\n\nKeeping one's distance and mining delicately may be enough to chip off a piece or two, but the process of natural selection need not be explained further.\n\nGood luck!" }
entries[439740] = { ["name"] = "Camouflage Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nAlthough it is already peculiar that some of the local plantlife on Khaz Algar have adapted to hide in plain sight, some rocks have mastered this skill, too. Observant craftsman, namely alchemists and engineers, have developed methods to pierce through this mysterious veil for those willing to invest in their success.\n\nAs for everyone else, their pockets will be a little less heavy than yours." }
entries[439741] = { ["name"] = "Webbed Theme", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nWhile plantlife might make for a good nest for spiders, sometimes a web needs a solid foundation to support extra weight. The Spindlespiders of Khaz Algar often build up intricate webs on rocky outcrops, much to the dismay of arachnophobic miners.\n\nAt least they offer an extra source of cloth!" }
entries[439742] = { ["name"] = "Overload Crystallized", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nOverloading a crystallized deposit will momentarily attune you to the world, creating a portal to send you to another nearby deposit. Specialized miners will open a portal back after gathering at their destination." }
entries[439743] = { ["name"] = "Overload Weeping", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nOverloading weeping deposits will cause an immediate mutation to occur and change them into a dangerous creature. This creature can provide a healthy source of Writhing Samples." }
entries[439744] = { ["name"] = "Overload Explosives", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nOverloading mining deposits riddled with dynamite seems like a chaotic and foolish decision but is nonetheless a practice growing in popularity as more and more armed mining deposits are abandoned. Miners lacking in self-preservation that overload these deposits will have mere seconds to gather extra ore, whilst pondering all of the choices that lead to that moment." }
entries[439746] = { ["name"] = "Echoing Shade", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nNx's shadows echo his Shade Slash in the direction they're currently facing." }
entries[439747] = { ["name"] = "Overload Webbed Deposits", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSpindlespiders have a tendency to nest up against sturdy rocky outcroppings. While most miners would prefer to collect what they can without disturbing them, overloading a webbed deposit will dislodge many spindlespiders that will attempt to scurry away. Catching these is a great source of additional cloth!" }
