entries[439843] = { ["name"] = "Reaper's Mark", ["text"] = "2 Runes Melee Range\nInstant 45 sec cooldown\nBlood\nViciously slice into the soul of your enemy, dealing (146.25% of Attack Power) Shadowfrost damage and applying Reaper's Mark.\n\nEach time you deal Shadow or Frost damage, add a stack of Reaper's Mark. After 12 sec or reaching 40 stacks, the mark explodes, dealing (17.9934% of Attack Power) damage per stack.\n\nReaper's Mark travels to an unmarked enemy nearby if the target dies.\n\nFrost\nViciously slice into the soul of your enemy, dealing (249.6% of Attack Power) Shadowfrost damage and applying Reaper's Mark.\n\nEach time you deal Shadow or Frost damage, add a stack of Reaper's Mark. After 12 sec or reaching 40 stacks, the mark explodes, dealing (32.3882% of Attack Power) damage per stack.\n\nReaper's Mark travels to an unmarked enemy nearby if the target dies." }
