entries[440042] = { ["name"] = "Darkening Soul", ["text"] = "Affliction\nPeriodic damage dealt by Corruption has a chance to cause the target to suffer (46.9878% of Spell Power) Shadowflame damage over 15 sec.\n\nMalefic Rapture damage consumes Darkening Soul, dealing the remaining damage instantly.\n\nDemonology, Destruction\nPeriodic damage dealt by Immolate has a chance to cause the target to suffer (46.9878% of Spell Power) Shadowflame damage over 15 sec.\n\nChaos Bolt damage consumes Darkening Soul, dealing the remaining damage instantly. Damage dealt by Rain of Fire consumes 1 sec of Darkening Soul." }
